flowchart TD
    A([Start: heading_not_within_tolerance_guard]) --> B{len(continuous_state) == 5?}
    B -->|No| Z1[/Raise ValueError/]
    B -->|Yes| C[waypoint = ctx.auxiliary_states'waypoints'.latest]
    C --> D{waypoint is None?}
    D -->|Yes| Z2[/Raise ValueError/]
    D -->|No| E["xx, xy, yaw = continuous_state[0:3]<br/>wx, wy = waypoint"]
    E --> F{agent position == waypoint?}
    F -->|Yes| G([Return False])
    F -->|No| H["desired = atan2(wy - xy, wx - xx)"]
    H --> I["error = normalize(desired - yaw) to [-pi, pi]"]
    I --> J{"abs(error) > heading_tolerance_on?"}
    J -->|Yes| K([Return True])
    J -->|No| L([Return False])
